&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR FUTURE, ON DEMAND&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal blend of stability and flexibility. A genuinely human employer that cares for people and the planet. True autonomy to shape what comes next, for us and you. This is the perfect platform to take your career where you want.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Back in 2005, we pioneered Europe’s first TV streaming service. Today, we&#39;re a leading TV streaming provider with millions of monthly users, and since 2021 we&#39;ve been ClimatePartner-certified. Over 200 colleagues of 47 nationalities. We’re the grown-up start-up, helping to shape a better future since day one.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;That hasn’t changed, even if the world has. We’re friendly, international, inclusive – and our people say we’re reliable and transparent, too. It’s why they trust us and believe in what we do.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Programmatic Sales GSA, you will be responsible for the automated and data-driven sale of our digital advertising inventory (primarily video and CTV) and report directly to the Director Sales All Markets. You will manage programmatic bookings, oversee the planning, implementation and optimisation of our initiatives to boost revenue in programmatic sales, and will therefore also be directly responsible for the optimisation and smooth, technical implementation of campaigns. This makes you the primary point of contact for agency trading desks in the GSA region regarding preferred deals and PMP strategies. You’ll also help with SSP and header bidding integrations and act as the link between Sales, Tech and AdOps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ADS TEAM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Ads Team is a small but highly efficient team that combines technology and marketing to win customers over in the long term. With a presence in two countries (based in Berlin, Hamburg and Zurich) and operations in six countries, the Ads Team is a key driver of growth within Zattoo and has established itself as the market leader in CTV in Switzerland within a year.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acquisition of new customers, advice, support and guide media agencies, trading desks and direct clients through our programmatic possibilities in a way they can understand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drawing up and negotiating bespoke programme packages, private deals or preferred deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maximise inventory revenue, skilfully manage floor prices (minimum prices) and analyse delivery rates and CPMs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with regional sales teams in GSA to consult clients and pitch programmatic solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-lead the technical and commercial setup of Header Bidding and additional SSP integrations for CTV.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First-line technical ownership of programmatic delivery.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify technical errors during delivery, analyse tracking issues and check campaign set-ups: troubleshoot deal delivery, floor pricing, and DSP configuration issues (e.g., SSAI, VAST responses, pod management, DSP/SSP bid stream mismatches).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explain complex technical matters in simple terms to non-technical customers or internal departments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in Programmatic Advertising, SSP Management, or Programmatic Account Management (strong experience in CTV/Video)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record in the sales of digital advertising products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of Google Ad Manager, DSP/SSP workflows, OpenRTB specs, and deal types (Preferred Deals, PMP, PG)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience or strong technical familiarity with Header Bidding frameworks (e.g., Prebid) and SSP integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong network or understanding of the DACH Agency Trading Desk landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in German and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independent, strong communicator, able to work under pressure, with strong negotiation skills&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Teamplayer and creative thinker with a questioning mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;WHY JOIN US?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Zattoo, you’re always on firm ground with real freedom to explore. You’ll have the support and opportunity you need to go far, while you’re helping us create a sustainable and entertainment-filled future for all.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER YOU&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reward&lt;/strong&gt;: strong market competitive salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recharge&lt;/strong&gt;: 30 days vacation plus public holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regulate&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;trust based flexible working hours and the option for remote work worldwide for up to 8 weeks per year&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Plus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;sharing:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Free access to the best streaming experience on the market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re developing: &lt;/strong&gt;Your own development budget, German classes and Zattoo all-company&amp;nbsp;hack days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re inclusive: ‘&lt;/strong&gt;Zattooies’ are a fun, engaged, and diverse team made up of 47 nationalities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re healthy:&lt;/strong&gt; Health checks, mental wellbeing support, team sports and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re responsible:&lt;/strong&gt; We are carbon neutral, an active employee Green team, discounted BVG tickets and free bike rentals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re sociable: &lt;/strong&gt;A&amp;nbsp;calendar of events with fireside chats, lunches, in-house bar, BBQ’s, monthly socials, summer party and an annual off-site event&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Zattoo enables our users to view indiscriminately and we reflect that in our team too. Regardless of race, gender, sexual orientation, religion, national origin, age, disability or any other characteristic protected by law we encourage everyone to apply and will give everyone equal consideration. We are an equal opportunities employer — join us and help build a diverse team dedicated to revolutionising the way you watch TV.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are committed to ensuring fair, open, and equitable hiring practices and are happy to answer any questions you may have about us or the role throughout the whole process. In line with the EU Pay Transparency Directive, we share the applicable compensation range with you before your first interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-justify&quot;&gt;You can learn more about us at: &lt;a href=&quot;https://zattoo.com/company/jobs/&quot;&gt;https://zattoo.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Aiven&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aiven is the open source based data platform that builders trust to run PostgreSQL®, Apache Kafka®, ClickHouse®, OpenSearch®, Valkey™ and more in production, on any cloud. Builders ship faster. Their companies run on data that stays available, secure and under control.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You own the commercial relationship with a book of existing Aiven customers across the UK &amp;amp; Ireland, worth more than $4m in ARR. Your job is to keep those customers, grow them, and turn their success into proof for the next customer. You spot risk early, and find the next use case before the customer asks for it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You also open new doors: cold and warm outreach into accounts that look like your best customers, from first conversation through close.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You lead with AI from the front. It shapes how you plan, how you engage and what you say in every customer conversation. Agents do the research, monitoring and first drafts; you decide what matters and where to push. The outcome is growth: more ARR retained, more expanded and more pipeline created, earlier and more predictably.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Why now: Aiven has ambitious growth plans, and we&#39;re on track. Every customer we serve is building AI, and AI depends on the data platform underneath it. Our open source based platform means no lock-in, so builders ship faster and our customers move with more innovation velocity. You sit at the centre of that, working with customers from Fintech and AI innovators through to Utilities whose AI ambitions depend on us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the strategic partnership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow each account in your book beyond its current baseline in usage and commitments. This is the primary mandate of the role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and run an account plan for every priority account, with clear goals, stakeholders, risks and expansion opportunities across the Aiven platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Solutions Architects and Technical Account Managers on technical validation, and bring in Product Engineering, Aiven leadership and executives where a customer needs senior backing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retain and grow ARR&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spot contraction and churn risk early, using usage and sentiment signals surfaced by agents, then act on them before the customer does. Build a protection plan for each risk with the Aiven customer team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Find cross-sell and upsell opportunities across the Aiven platform, and see them through to close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run renewals as a plan, not an event. Know the commercial position, the decision makers and the competing options well before the renewal date. Lead commercial and contract negotiation through to signature.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualify and manage every renewal, expansion and new logo opportunity with MEDDPICC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build relationships at every level&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with the builders who use the Aiven platform day to day (engineering, platform and product leads) and the teams who consume the services it delivers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with executives, budget holders and senior IT decision makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn happy customers into proof&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use your relationships to build positive sentiment, then work with Marketing to turn it into events, webinars, case studies and references matched to the right prospect.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Aiven at UKI industry events, and feed customer, competitive and market insight back to Product, Engineering and leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Open new doors&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own new logo opportunities in the UKI territory, from prospecting through close, using cold and warm outreach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run the book AI-native&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own how your work gets done: decide which tasks you do, which agents do and which stop entirely. Review this as the tools improve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run account research, risk and usage monitoring, outreach drafting and forecasting through agents. Spend your time on judgment, relationships and negotiation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep Salesforce accurate so the forecast, and the agents reading it, reflect reality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share what works with the team. The way you work is a product too.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience owning a book of existing customers in enterprise B2B software, with a record of retaining and growing ARR, managing renewals and churn risk, and negotiating contracts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling to technical users and to executive buyers, and adjusting your message for each.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A structured approach to account planning and multi-threading.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication in English, written and spoken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily, hands-on use of AI tools in your sales workflow, with examples of work you have redesigned or cut as a result.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High agency: a record of owning accounts end-to-end and solving hard problems without waiting for a blueprint.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience co-selling with cloud providers and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with usage-based or consumption pricing, and with using usage data to spot risk and opportunity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling open source based data technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running customer advocacy: references, case studies, event speakers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we measure success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quota attainment, net revenue retention and gross revenue retention for your book, against target.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expansion ARR from cross-sell and upsell, against target.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Churn and contraction risks flagged early, each with a documented protection plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive and budget holder coverage across priority accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer references, case studies and event speakers delivered each year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pipeline creation, deal progression and on-time opportunity booking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecast accuracy and CRM hygiene.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time spent on customer conversations vs. admin and research, trending the right way quarter on quarter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workflow improvements adopted by the wider team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role context&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team: Field Sales EMEA South.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Book: more than $4m ARR across existing customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customers: Fintech and AI innovators through to Utilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reports to: EMEA South Sales Director.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First 90 days: learn the business, the technology, your customer base and how we work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focus: existing customers first, with new logo opportunities in UKI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Works closely with: Solutions Architects, Technical Account Managers, Support, Product Engineering, Marketing, Sales Development and Aiven leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: London, UK, with the right to work there. Hybrid working, with regular time together in the London hub for planning and deal reviews, and travel to customers as needed. Adjustments available.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
